{'symbol': 'DXC', 'date': '2021-12-15 09:10:00', 'title': 'DXC TECHNOLOGY NAMES KRISTIE GRINNELL SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF INFORMATION OFFICER', 'text': "ASHBURN, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DXC TECHNOLOGY (NYSE: DXC), A LEADING FORTUNE 500 GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY SERVICES PROVIDER, HAS APPOINTED KRISTIE GRINNELL AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF INFORMATION OFFICER (CIO). GRINNELL, WHO PREVIOUSLY SERVED AS GLOBAL CIO AND VICE PRESIDENT FOR SUPPLY CHAIN AT GENERAL DYNAMICS INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY (GDIT), WILL REPORT TO CHRIS DRUMGOOLE, DXC'S EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER (COO). SHE SUCCEEDS DRUMGOOLE, WHO WAS PROMOTED TO COO IN AUGUST"}